        },
        {
          "text": " Je! Hamkuwafukuza makuhani wa BWANA, wana wa Haruni, na Walawi; mkajifanyia makuhani kama wafanyavyo watu wa nchi nyingine? Hata yeyote ajaye kujifanya wakfu na ndama, na kondoo dume saba, aweza kuwa kuhani wa hiyo isiyo miungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
