        },
        {
          "text": " Na tazama, Mungu yu pamoja nasi atutangulie, na makuhani wake wenye parapanda, ili wapige sauti ya kuanza vita juu yenu. Enyi wana wa Israeli, msipigane na BWANA, Mungu wa baba zenu; kwani hamtafanikiwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.12"
            ]
